WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.040
The ECG measures voltage differences generated by the combined activity of many cells. It helps describe timing and the direction of activation. It is not a recording from one cell, and it is not a pressure transducer or a direct measure of contractile strength.
心电图测量许多细胞共同活动产生的电压差，帮助描述激动的时序和方向。它不是单个细胞的记录，也不是测压装置或收缩力的直接测量。

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:35.016
Keep the distinction throughout this chapter: cellular events help explain the tracing, while pulse and perfusion explain the patient. A technically organized tracing may coexist with very poor output. Conversely, a noisy tracing may occur in someone with a normal pulse.
贯穿本章保留这个区别：细胞事件帮助解释波形，脉搏和灌注帮助解释患者。有组织的波形可能伴随极低输出；杂乱记录也可能出现在脉搏正常的人身上。

00:00:35.016 --> 00:00:54.504
Activation normally begins in the sinoatrial node and spreads through the atria. The atrioventricular node introduces a delay before the signal travels through the His bundle, right and left bundle branches, and Purkinje fibres. This sequence supports ventricular filling before ventricular contraction.
激动通常始于窦房结并在心房传播。房室结形成延迟后，信号经希氏束、左右束支及浦肯野纤维传播。这种顺序有助于心室先充盈、后收缩。

00:00:54.504 --> 00:01:11.880
A delay is not automatically a block, and a backup pacemaker is not automatically a new disease. Ask whether the normal pathway is working, whether the impulse is conducted reliably, and whether a lower structure has taken over because the dominant pacemaker is suppressed.
传导延迟不一定就是异常阻滞；备用起搏点接管也不自动代表新的疾病。应判断正常通路是否工作、激动是否可靠下传，以及优势起搏点受抑制后是否由下级接管。

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:29.712
The school uses a hierarchy of about sixty to one hundred per minute for sinus pacing, forty to sixty for the AV junction, and twenty to forty for a ventricular escape focus. These are teaching ranges for rhythm recognition, not guaranteed rates or treatment thresholds.
学校用窦性起搏约每分钟60至100次、房室交界区40至60次、心室逸搏灶20至40次建立层级。这些是节律识别的教学范围，不是保证出现的心率，也不是治疗阈值。

00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:47.328
An escape rhythm arrives because the expected dominant impulse did not take control. A premature ectopic beat arrives early. Timing therefore matters as much as the shape of the complex when you decide whether a lower pacemaker is protecting the circulation or competing with it.
逸搏是优势激动未按预期主导时出现的备用节律；异位早搏则提前出现。因此，判断下级起搏点是在保护循环还是与原节律竞争时，时序与波形同样重要。

00:01:47.328 --> 00:02:07.104
For a working ventricular muscle cell, phase zero is a rapid sodium-dependent depolarization. Phase one is brief early repolarization. During phase two, calcium entry and potassium exit support a plateau. Phase three repolarization is followed by the resting phase four.
对工作心室肌细胞而言，0期是依赖钠的快速去极化，1期是短暂早期复极，2期由钙内流和钾外流支持平台，3期复极后进入4期静息状态。

00:02:07.104 --> 00:02:26.256
Do not apply that ventricular diagram unchanged to nodal pacemaker cells. Their automaticity and upstroke differ. The school links sodium-channel blockers, calcium-channel effects and class-three antiarrhythmics to these processes conceptually; that does not confer authority to administer those drugs.
不要把这张心室肌示意图原封不动套到结区起搏细胞，其自律性和上升支机制不同。学校用钠通道阻滞、钙通道效应及III类抗心律失常药帮助理解机制，但这不构成给药授权。

00:02:26.256 --> 00:02:46.272
The QRS reflects the summed sequence of ventricular depolarization. The ST segment broadly corresponds to ventricular cells remaining depolarized during the plateau, and the T wave reflects recovery. A nearly flat ST segment does not mean that the myocardium has no electrical activity.
QRS 反映心室去极化的整体传播过程；ST 段大体对应心室细胞在平台期保持去极化，T 波反映复极恢复。ST 段接近水平，并不表示心肌没有电活动。

00:02:46.272 --> 00:03:05.664
The school simplifies cellular phases into surface correlates. Do not turn this into a rule that every phase produces its own visible mark, particularly a post-QRS notch for phase one. Lead direction, timing across many cells and conduction differences shape the surface signal.
学校把细胞分期简化为体表波形关联，但不能据此断言每一期都有独立可见标志，尤其不能要求1期一定出现 QRS 后切迹。导联方向、群体细胞时序及传导差异共同形成体表信号。
